 "answer": "The two attributes are **`context_window`** and **`num_output`** on LlamaIndex's `Settings` object (`llama_index.core.Settings`).\n\n- **`Settings.context_window`** is the maximum input size, in tokens, that is sent to the LLM.\n- **`Settings.num_output`** is the number of tokens reserved for the model's generated output.\n\nIn recent versions, both properties read from and write to the underlying `prompt_helper`. I'm working from memory, so the exact defaults and property behavior may differ across LlamaIndex releases. Check the docs or source for your installed version if you need precise details.",
